<title>UK: Swiss Bank Corp sets warrants on Motorola.</title>
<headline>Swiss Bank Corp sets warrants on Motorola.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued a total of 250,000 BLOC warrants, on Motorola Inc, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    **			  ISSUE PRICE    *$42.02</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   16.SEP.97		 PAYDATE	01.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   =			   MIN EXER LOT ONE</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  *$47.75</p>
<p> NOTES	    *INDICATED LEVELS</p>
<p>		   **LOWER STRIKE PRICE IS $0.0</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
